---
description: Transfile stack, security, and UI rules
alwaysApply: true
---
Project: Transfile, a file sharing app with folders, passwords and expiry.

Structure: apps/web (React+Vite), apps/api (Hono on Workers),
packages/shared (Zod schemas/types).

Rules:
- TypeScript strict. No `any`.
- Validate ALL request input with Zod schemas from packages/shared.
- All DB access via Drizzle. Never build SQL from user input.
- Auth uses Better Auth. Do not hand-roll sessions or password hashing.
- Every route touching a file/folder/share MUST verify the user owns it.
- Never trust client-reported file sizes: verify against R2 after upload.
- Free Worker CPU limit is ~10ms: avoid heavy work in requests.
- Uploads/downloads use presigned R2 URLs, never streamed through the Worker.
- Read SPEC.md before implementing. One feature per session.

UI:
- shadcn/ui (Radix, Maia preset) + Tailwind only. Restyle base components
  once in components/ui.
- No pills. Circles only for avatars and the notification count bubble.
  Buttons, inputs, nav, tabs, chips, and cards use the radius tokens.
- Concentric radii: a child corner is the parent radius minus the padding
  between them, never below 6px. Use Surface, which sets its radius and
  padding and publishes --parent-r and --parent-pad. Inner blocks use
  rounded-inset. Do not hard-code hex or radii outside index.css.
- Headings use the display serif (Fraunces, weight 800). Body and UI stay Geist.
- Icons are Lucide through AppIcon only. Size and stroke live on that component.
- Palette tokens only. Brand blue is the primary action. Dark ink is the
  secondary action. Public pages may use the cloudy sky. The signed-in app
  stays on the light surface. No glows, gradient borders, or decorative motion.
- Motion only for functional transitions, plus the landing collage float.
- Mobile-first: Drawer on mobile, Dialog on desktop.
- Reference designs are in /docs/ui-references.

Radii:
- --r-control 12px, --r-card 24px, --r-sheet 28px, floor 6px.
- Child radius = max(parent radius - parent padding, 6px).
- Surface is the only place that sets both the element radius and the
  inherited --parent-r / --parent-pad variables.
